{"id":"n89919-2-10","stage":2,"title":"없어지다 · 没有了","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89919-2-10-1","ko":"식탁 위에 있던 빵이 다 없어져 버렸네.","zh":"桌子上的面包全都不见了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"식탁","meaning":"餐桌","explanation":"식탁：餐桌","readings":[{"term":"식탁","audio":"/audio/54440e480486cc26718c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26869","senseId":"1","lemma":"식탁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"위에","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"3","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있던","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빵이","meaning":"面包","explanation":"빵：面包；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"빵","audio":"/audio/edc73c627b8f32b7f6a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23402","senseId":"1","lemma":"빵","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어져","meaning":"没有了，不见了","explanation":"없어지다：没有了，不见了；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"없어지다","audio":"/audio/f36e3bda333541f958ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89919","senseId":"2","lemma":"없어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"버렸네.","meaning":"完","explanation":"버리다：完；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"54440e480486cc26","term":"식탁","zh":"餐桌","audio":"/audio/54440e480486cc26718c.mp3","entryId":"26869","definition":"用于摆放食物、围坐起来用餐的桌子。","pronunciation":["식탁"]},{"id":"e0bebb354d8f7f3b","term":"위","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3","entryId":"71462","definition":"某东西的表面或平坦的表面。","pronunciation":["위"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"edc73c627b8f32b7","term":"빵","zh":"面包","audio":"/audio/edc73c627b8f32b7f6a1.mp3","entryId":"23402","definition":"将面粉揉和并使之发酵后，蒸或烤而成的食物。","pronunciation":["빵"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"f36e3bda333541f9","term":"없어지다","zh":"没有了，不见了","audio":"/audio/f36e3bda333541f958ef.mp3","entryId":"89919","definition":"人、事物、现象等不再在某处占据空间或存在。","pronunciation":["업ː써지다"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"完","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"62601","definition":"表示前面所说的行动已完全结束。","pronunciation":["버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3319fd0e0bf845230de0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89919-2-10-2","ko":"응, 아까 네 동생이 다 먹었어.","zh":"嗯，刚才你弟弟把它们全吃掉了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동생이","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹었어.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"bc9b651fd875fefc","term":"동생","zh":"弟弟；妹妹","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3","entryId":"70748","definition":"用于指称或称呼相同父母所生的兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年幼的人。","pronunciation":["동생"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"一点不剩或不落下而全部。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/42367c75ee7b2452cf72.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.388,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89919","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":76,"sequenceScore":2.1133,"questions":[{"